      "created_at": "2014-10-29T14:40:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi. I just got today my package from USA with the rook city and infernal relics expansion. I sleeved all the cards and I noticed my deck for nightmist hast only 39 cards (+1 for the card with the hero picture and stats) instead of 40 as all the other heroes normally have. Is this normal? If a card is missing, is there a quick way to get to know which one? And how do I get it, by Greater Than Games? Since I live in Austria sending everything back to US would be a little overkill&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"> . Thanks in advance&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/neutral_face.png?v=9\" title=\":neutral_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":neutral_face:\"> <br><br>PS: Sorry if this is not the right thread. It was the best I could find <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
