      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/e19adc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-29T19:04:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;No guys, we were two, me and a friend, who were unpackaging and sleeving the cards. We checked three times and now I checked again the whole box, I also unsleeved all nightmist cards and checked if two stuck together - nothing. I also opened the divider cards (I used the divider from my 2nd edition box so there was no need till you brought up that topic) but there was no card within.</p><p>The card missing from my deck is CALL FORTH, but I do not know which spell number. I have on with a 1 and one with a 4 but since it must be three cards (thx Pydro). I will tell it Jodie, thanks for the hint, Matchstickman! I will check my shattered timelines expansion tomorrow. Never had such an issue, but well, can happen, can't it :-)? Thanks guys, didn't think I would have found the missing card that quick without you :-)</p>",
